<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Double Pump Mastiff macro for Apex Legends. Fires the Mastiff and times the follow-up shot and pump so you can fire twice in quick succession with a single key press. Timings are tuned for the Mastiff’s fire rate. Bind it to a mouse button or key of your choice, and test it in the Firing Range before using it in a match. Adjust the delays in the file if your ping or settings differ.(purple stock and bolt requried)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 30 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 30 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 30 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyDown 31 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyUp 31 1
Delay 30 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 30 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyDown 30 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 30 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 30 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 30 ms
Goto 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>